      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 79678,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769009281599999
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. A proper fit is essential. Was the issue with the overall size, or something more specific, like where the cleats are positioned?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769009284933332
    },
